BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (one-hour call on discovery, with the prospect talking about 75% of the time. Botero's warning is never to skip) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (the pain: 'stab the knife and twist it' [r2vbi9gCm-o @ 00:08:04]. Daniel Coutts runs a longer chain. Coutts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (frames the call, extracts a 'tangible outcome' goal, and establishes the time gap. Then Coutts prehandles) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (limiting beliefs \(time, money, having been scammed, the wife, the parent\), treats every objection as a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (smokescreen, and probes with what, why, and how while acting 'really dumb' [RHobLxb_gLQ @ 00:15:24].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (Both state the price flat. Coutts says 'investment is 6k' and closes for paid in full, weighing it against one to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (three years of staying the same. Botero says 'It's $5,000' confidently, then backs it with opportunity cost: a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm ($100K salary is $8,300 a month, so landing a job two months faster is worth $16,000 against the $5,000 fee) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm ([r2vbi9gCm-o @ 00:12:32].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (Landing the seat runs on the same mechanics. Frankie Isaac's reframe is that you are the product and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (offer owner is the prospect. That means skipping free Facebook groups and job boards, finding owners on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (YouTube and Instagram by spotting CTAs, VSLs, and testimonials, and never DMing 'are you hiring?') Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm ([_ZU2OAxnSMI @ 00:04:06]. Isaac's Loom runs 60 seconds and covers hook, track record, character, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (CTA. The interview gets treated as a sales call and closes on 'anything...make you hesitant?' Hudson) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (Cosper's version is a three-line DM plus a 60-second Loom, followed by follow-up. Cosper's student Zach) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (sent about 100 messages, got 4 offers, and made $8K in 30 days [4HgyBCSnkLE @ 00:08:57]. The Closer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (ID pushes raw volume. They sent 480 messages in their first week and say 20 messages take about 10) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (minutes, so 100 a day is achievable for anyone. They block social apps with Opal and generate 100-1,000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (Instagram keywords once, using ChatGPT with Whisper Flow dictation [sh92NTG_jgs @ 00:03:10]. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (opener is deliberately unpersonalized: 'Yo, boss. I think it's so sick what you're doing. Do you have your own) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (coaching or course?' Only after the coach replies does the closer reference one of their reels and ask) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (whether they need a high-ticket closer [sh92NTG_jgs @ 00:07:34].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (Upstream, Scale Like ZK works the weekly math backwards. One buyer a week at about a one-in-three) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (close rate needs 3-4 calls. That takes 5 bookings and 8-9 applications, which comes to roughly 170 page) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (visitors at their 20-25% page-to-application rate, against 5% generally [uBQvqV_-nz0 @ 00:01:09]. ZK's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (application states a 'multi four-figure' investment level and asks about cash on hand. A $500 answer means) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (cancelling the call or offering a low-ticket downsell. Speed to lead is measured in minutes. KPIs get checked) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (weekly, because a bad show rate alone can turn $50K into $5K [uBQvqV_-nz0 @ 00:13:44]. Hernan) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm (Vazquez benchmarks low-ticket ascension at about 10% of buyers reaching a call, or 7-10 calls per 100) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (buyers. From there Vazquez runs a 2-3 email consumption sequence, then one to two weeks of testimonial) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.90 Tm (and case-study emails. Daisy-chained webinar and VSL campaigns follow, and finally a daily broadcast with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 145.67 Tm (a book-a-call link. Vazquez reports leads converting after 2-3 years on the list [PeOr6rOEN2Q @ 00:05:35].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 130.45 Tm (Brandon Mulrenin, working real-estate listings, reports that only 10-15% of first calls set an appointment,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 115.22 Tm (while 85-90% of deals come from follow-up. That is why Mulrenin has the prospect author both the next time) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 100.00 Tm (to talk and the reason for it [phMoT_2rYN4 @ 00:13:51].) Tj ET
