BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (Title: Close Clean) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (Action: Paper joint representation, keep funds in escrow, and memorialize reasonable belief at closing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (Detail: Get written disclosure and consent from both sides for joint representation, stay out of financing and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (buyer groups, and treat securities received as Rule 144 restricted [ALC Lawcast: Finance in Focus -) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (o-XOblDUBuI @ 00:01:39].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (The structuring checklist is concrete. IBBA's panel lists the core condition: the buyer takes control, presumed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (at 25%, and actively operates the business; if the seller rolls equity over, the seller must receive buyer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (financials, and the broker documents a 'reasonable belief' in the engagement letter or in the closing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (documents [7mV4t9a4PvE @ 00:21:04]. Laura Anthony spells out what active operation looks like on paper:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (the buyer can operate by electing officers or approving the budget [R0kgCi34_1s @ 00:01:59]. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (disclosure package is specific: before closing, get written control assurances, and hand anyone receiving) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (securities year-end financials, unaudited is acceptable, plus a balance sheet no more than 120 days old) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm ([uqd9CdrsWKo @ 00:02:09]. Anthony's federal checklist bans binding the parties, arranging financing,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (taking custody, public offerings, shell companies, and forming buyer groups; joint representation of both) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (sides needs written disclosure and consent from both, securities received are restricted under Rule 144, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (a barred or suspended broker cannot use the exemption [o-XOblDUBuI @ 00:01:39]. The IBBA panel adds) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (two structure flags: a non-assignable earnout is usually not a security, but an F-reorg or any equity) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (exchange is almost certainly a securities transaction.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (Florida is the most fully mapped state playbook. ALC Lawcast's Laura Anthony dates the Florida exemption) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (to July 1, 2016, under Sections 517.061\(22\) and 517.12\(22\), and says M&A brokers there may collect) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (success fees and commissions without a license [rl3PWicoIaE @ 00:02:26]. Anthony calls Florida stricter) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (than the SEC: the company must have no Exchange Act registration or reports, and in the prior fiscal year) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (must show EBITDA under $25M or gross revenue of $250M, adjusted for inflation. Securities sit with the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (Office of Financial Regulation under Chapter 517, and the exemption requires a private company, no public) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (offering, and no shell company [bfazVN-7QhQ @ 00:03:17]. Anthony also flags an aggressive angle: the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (Florida rule may have opened the way for OTCQX reverse or forward mergers without registration, even) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (though Florida is one of five states with no issuer's exemption for public offerings. The Florida limits repeat) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (the no-custody, no-public-offering, no-public-shell triad, add bad-actor disqualifications that reach Rule 506) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (and Reg A, and drop the control presumption to 20% [uqd9CdrsWKo @ 00:03:44]. On marketing, Anthony) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (says M&A brokers may advertise their location and price range [R0kgCi34_1s @ 00:03:05].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm (Cross-border deal flow runs on its own mechanics. CertFuel defines a non-resident broker-dealer as one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (with no US place of business or that keeps its principal records abroad, and warns the rule does not cover a) Tj ET
