BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 145.67 Tm (complete, current copies of records, written notice of that address, and a written undertaking to produce at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 130.45 Tm (the firm's expense; summaries, partial copies, or lagging copies fail, and once the SEC sends a written) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 115.22 Tm (demand by registered mail the firm has exactly 14 days, counted from sending, not opening. For Canadian) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 100.00 Tm (dealers, CertFuel's Series 63 drill sets limited registration effective on day 30, renewal by December 1,) Tj ET
